safix::no_editor

  × neither $VISUAL nor $EDITOR is set, so there is no editor to open; nothing
  │ was decrypted or staged.
  │ 
  │ Set one of them and re-run. safix opens no editor of its own choosing: a
  │ program you did not pick, holding your plaintext, can be left or saved by
  │ accident and safix cannot tell which happened.
